From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zincwolf <zincwolf@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 16:41:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Support pretokenized text calibration and layer replay

Load shared token artifacts with optional sample/layer limits. Capture per-batch decoder arguments on CPU, reuse shared tensors, and stop before the LM head. Restore layers and hooks on failure and move cached kwargs back to the training device.
---
